flowchart TB
  Caller["Start here: caller\nGrove or another tool"]:::start
  Native["harness-dispatch\nRust command and record store"]
  Settings["Owner settings\nBounds, grants, record directory"]
  Worker["Private policy worker\nCompiled Bun + TypeScript SDK"]
  Policy["Owner policy: one select function\nEvery command it can return"]
  Adapter["Optional Grove adapter\nReads only the supplied task file"]
  Choice["Optional choice file\nNames options the policy offers"]
  Harness["Selected command\nProgram, arguments, owner's labels"]
  Caller -->|"1. Kind, prompt, parameters, task, context"| Native
  Settings -.->|"Read before the worker starts"| Native
  Native -->|"2. Bounded request with the prompt; no control env"| Worker
  Worker -->|"3. Evaluate the personal entry"| Policy
  Policy -.->|"Explicit import"| Adapter
  Policy -.->|"SDK helper it calls"| Choice
  Policy -->|"4. Command + labels + reason, or a refusal"| Native
  Native -->|"5. Record, then exec"| Harness
  classDef start fill:#163a57,color:#fff,stroke:#163a57,font-weight:bold
